Rayburn</surname><given-names>H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bronson</surname><given-names>R.T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Rando</surname><given-names>T.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hynes</surname><given-names>R.O.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dystrophic muscle in mice chimeric for expression of &#x003b1;5 integrin</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>143</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>849</fpage><lpage>859</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9813102</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R67"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Todd</surname><given-names>S.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Lipps</surname><given-names>S.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Crisa</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Salomon</surname><given-names>D.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsoukas</surname><given-names>C.D.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CD81 expressed on human thymocytes mediates integrin activation and interleukin 2&#x02013;dependent proliferation</article-title><source>J. Exp. Med.</source><volume>184</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>2055</fpage><lpage>2060</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8920895</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R68"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vachon</surname><given-names>P.H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Loechel</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Wewer</surname><given-names>U.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Engvall</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Merosin and laminin in myogenesis&#x0003b; specific requirement for merosin in myotube stability</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>134</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>1